sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Au as Author
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API as API routes
  participant SV as Check service
  participant AG as GateX engine
  participant RT as Examiners 1, 2, 3
  participant CO as Final reviewer
  participant DB as Postgres

  Au->>UI: add a file + a scorecard
  UI->>API: POST /api/runs (multipart)
  API->>SV: submit()
  Note over SV: read the scorecard · check the models are set up<br/>open the file · check the sheets it names exist
  SV->>DB: create the check (queued), next round number
  SV-->>API: run id
  API-->>UI: 202 Accepted
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/:id every 1.5 s

  Note over SV,AG: runs in the background after the 202
  SV->>AG: evaluate()
  Note over AG: freeze: read once, fingerprint the file and the scorecard<br/>count: exact counts scored in code
  par three Examiners at the same time
    AG->>RT: same instructions (scorecard + file + sources)
    RT-->>AG: marks 0-5 per question, cited cells, issues
  end
  Note over AG: keep only claims whose cited cell really exists
  AG->>CO: three sets of checked marks + the file
  CO-->>AG: agreed marks, merged issues
  Note over AG: apply the rules: range check, lower mark stands, colour by a fixed rule<br/>check the file again, stop if it changed
  AG-->>SV: result (scores, issues, record)
  SV->>DB: store the check, scores, issues, every model call
  UI->>API: GET /api/runs/:id
  API->>DB: load the check
  API-->>UI: report (verdict, issues, path to green, charts)
